# Optional. By default the app derives the API address from the Expo dev server (same laptop,
# same Wi-Fi). Set this for tunnel mode or to point a build at a deployed backend.
# For EAS builds, set it in the profile's "env" in eas.json instead (see docs/11-deployment.md).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL="https://your-backend.onrender.com/graphql"
